{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38588","headline":"池上双凫二首 二 · 吴融","name":"池上双凫二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双凫狎得傍池台，戏藻衔蒲远又回。\n敢爲稻粱凌险去，幸无鹰隼触波来。\n万丝春雨眠时乱，一片浓萍浴处开。\n不在笼栏夜仍好，月汀星沼剩裴回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38588.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38588","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}